  "id": "cboettig/gbif",
  "title": "H3-Indexed cloud-optimized snapshots of GBIF ",
  "description": "Cloud-optimized GeoParquet snapshots of Global Biodiversity Information Facility (GBIF) occurrence records, extended with H3 hierarchical hexagonal spatial index keys at resolutions 0\u201310. The dataset covers over 3 billion biodiversity occurrences and is partitioned into ~430 GB of Parquet files to enable fast spatial aggregations at any H3 resolution using DuckDB.",
